==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} ''[[mund]]'', from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*munþaz}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*ment-}}. Cognate with Low German {{m|nds|Mund}}, Dutch {{m|nl|mond}}, English {{m|en|mouth}}, Danish {{m|da|mund}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/mʊnt/|lang=de}}
