===Etymology 2===
From an earlier [[Munt]], from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*mundō}}. The retention of /d/ in the combination /nd/ is a signature of northern [[High German]] dialects and only becomes widespread after a period in the middle ages where the southern [[reflex]] /nt/ is favoured in southern writings.

